ANetRLogin v0.2.0 

Outbound RLogin for classic DOS BBS systems.
16-bit DOS/OpenDoors door + Win32 bridge.
Supports DOOR.SYS/FOSSIL, per-node sessions, multiple
allowlisted RLogin destinations, %USER%/%ALIAS%/%PASSWORD% mapping,
ANSI terminal relay, and quick ESC-ESC-ESC return to the BBS.
Low-latency v0.2 network/IPC relay engine.
Developed/tested with Spitfire on A-Net Online.

By: A-Net Online / StingRay
